(1427,	66,	'description',	'I’m a successful multipassioned entrepreneur in personal branding and former industry leader in real estate. After a decade in corporate business development in the real estate industry and successfully building my personal brand on social media, I launched multiple ventures. Based in Malmo, Sweden, I am passionate about business development, leadership, and empowering women pursue their dreams by starting their online businesses.\r\n\r\nIn 2023, I started my coaching business while balancing a corporate job and family. My journey began in 2016, focusing on helping women embrace their uniqueness with confidence. Today, I inspire women globally, coaching &amp; encouraging them to stand out and succeed.\r\n\r\nI built a multi-figure business with a dedicated audience and small team, and I LOVE helping women achieve success by packaging their unique million dollar genius &amp; personal brands.'),
